title: Walking Stick
text: Drag a REFLECTOR from the toolbox onto the board, and click it to turn it. A reflector is a mirror: it bounces the beam off at a right angle. Bend the beam into a walking stick so that it lights every pinwheel.
trick: routing with reflectors
motif: walking stick
ink: 2.5
expect: shared>=2
---
